      "values:originalText": "Add:\n6OAB  Royal Commissions to which this Part applies\n\nThis Part applies to:\n\n(a) the Child Sexual Abuse Royal Commission; and\n\n(b) any other Royal Commission prescribed by the regulations.",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n6OAB  Royal Commissions to which this Part applies\n\nThis Part applies to:\n\n(a) the Child Sexual Abuse Royal Commission; and\n\n(b) any other Royal Commission prescribed by the regulations.",
