    {
      "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019-sch-1-sec-6ob-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6OB(4) Power to hold private sessions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019#sch-1-sec-6ob-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If a private session is held for a Royal Commission under\nsubsection (1), any member of the Commission holding the private\nsession may (subject to the Letters Patent establishing the\nCommission and Division 3) determine any matters relating to the\nconduct of the private session, having regard to any directions\ngiven by the Chair of the Commission.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If a private session is held for a Royal Commission under\nsubsection (1), any member of the Commission holding the private\nsession may (subject to the Letters Patent establishing the\nCommission and Division 3) determine any matters relating to the\nconduct of the private session, having regard to any directions\ngiven by the Chair of the Commission.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019-sch-1-sec-6ob"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019-sch-1-sec-6ob-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019-sch-1-sec-6ob-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019-sch-1-sec-6ob-ss-4-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bb2bb0b2a943f6ab2ce46a72f14818bc8a31c2eef25efb756c496601b6661612",
      "skos:note": "Commission members can determine matters during private sessions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019#sch-1-sec-6ob-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6OB(4) Power to hold private sessions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If a private session is held for a Royal Commission under\nsubsection (1), any member of the Commission holding the private\nsession may (subject to the Letters Patent establishing the\nCommission and Division 3) determine any matters relating to the\nconduct of the private session, having regard to any directions\ngiven by the Chair of the Commission."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019-sch-1-sec-6ob-ss-4-norm",
