    {
      "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019-sch-1-sec-16",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "16 Subsections 6OC(3) and (4)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019#sch-1-sec-16"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsections, substitute:\nPowers of Commission and custody and use of records\n\n(3) Sections 6F (power of Commission in relation to documents and\nother things), 6P (Commission may communicate information) and\n9 (custody and use of records of Royal Commission) apply as if\ninformation, a document, record or other thing that was:\n\n(a) obtained at a private session for a Royal Commission by a\nmember holding the private session; or\n\n(b) given to a member, or member of the staff, of a Royal\nCommission for the purposes of a private session (whether or\n\nSchedule 1  Main amendments\n\nRoyal Commissions Amendment (Private Sessions) Act 2019\nNo. 64, 2019\n\nnot a private session was, or is to be, held for the\nCommission);\nwere produced before, delivered or given to, or otherwise obtained\nor received by, the Commission.\n\n(4) Section 9 (custody and use of records of Royal Commission) also\napplies as if a record that was produced:\n\n(a) at a private session for a Royal Commission by a member\nholding the private session; or\n\n(b) by a member, or member of the staff, of a Royal Commission\nfor the purposes of a private session (whether or not a private\nsession was, or is to be, held for the Commission);\nwere produced by the Commission.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsections, substitute:\nPowers of Commission and custody and use of records\n\n(3) Sections 6F (power of Commission in relation to documents and\nother things), 6P (Commission may communicate information) and\n9 (custody and use of records of Royal Commission) apply as if\ninformation, a document, record or other thing that was:\n\n(a) obtained at a private session for a Royal Commission by a\nmember holding the private session; or\n\n(b) given to a member, or member of the staff, of a Royal\nCommission for the purposes of a private session (whether or\n\nSchedule 1  Main amendments\n\nRoyal Commissions Amendment (Private Sessions) Act 2019\nNo. 64, 2019\n\nnot a private session was, or is to be, held for the\nCommission);\nwere produced before, delivered or given to, or otherwise obtained\nor received by, the Commission.\n\n(4) Section 9 (custody and use of records of Royal Commission) also\napplies as if a record that was produced:\n\n(a) at a private session for a Royal Commission by a member\nholding the private session; or\n\n(b) by a member, or member of the staff, of a Royal Commission\nfor the purposes of a private session (whether or not a private\nsession was, or is to be, held for the Commission);\nwere produced by the Commission.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019-sch-1-sec-16-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019-sch-1-sec-16-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "feeed67957f19525f3da13ef2cdda3f7a1668ecbe80dcd671a976f32e7bc6c3a"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019#sch-1-sec-16",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "16 Subsections 6OC(3) and (4)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 9,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsections, substitute:\nPowers of Commission and custody and use of records\n\n(3) Sections 6F (power of Commission in relation to documents and\nother things), 6P (Commission may communicate information) and\n9 (custody and use of records of Royal Commission) apply as if\ninformation, a document, record or other thing that was:\n\n(a) obtained at a private session for a Royal Commission by a\nmember holding the private session; or\n\n(b) given to a member, or member of the staff, of a Royal\nCommission for the purposes of a private session (whether or\n\nSchedule 1  Main amendments\n\nRoyal Commissions Amendment (Private Sessions) Act 2019\nNo. 64, 2019\n\nnot a private session was, or is to be, held for the\nCommission);\nwere produced before, delivered or given to, or otherwise obtained\nor received by, the Commission.\n\n(4) Section 9 (custody and use of records of Royal Commission) also\napplies as if a record that was produced:\n\n(a) at a private session for a Royal Commission by a member\nholding the private session; or\n\n(b) by a member, or member of the staff, of a Royal Commission\nfor the purposes of a private session (whether or not a private\nsession was, or is to be, held for the Commission);\nwere produced by the Commission."
    },
