      "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019-sch-1-sec-16-ss-3-logic-cogai-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:CogAI"
      },
      "cml:operator": "within",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Provisions apply to documents and other things within a certain time frame.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "sparql_library::parsers::chk_parser",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) Sections 6F (power of Commission in relation to documents and\nother things), 6P (Commission may communicate information) and\n9 (custody and use of records of Royal Commission) apply as if...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...were produced before, delivered or given to, or otherwise obtained\nor received by, the Commission."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019-sch-1-sec-16-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "16(4) Subsections 6OC(3) and (4)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019#sch-1-sec-16-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Section 9 (custody and use of records of Royal Commission) also\napplies as if a record that was produced:\n\n(a) at a private session for a Royal Commission by a member\nholding the private session; or\n\n(b) by a member, or member of the staff, of a Royal Commission\nfor the purposes of a private session (whether or not a private\nsession was, or is to be, held for the Commission);\nwere produced by the Commission.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Section 9 (custody and use of records of Royal Commission) also\napplies as if a record that was produced:\n\n(a) at a private session for a Royal Commission by a member\nholding the private session; or\n\n(b) by a member, or member of the staff, of a Royal Commission\nfor the purposes of a private session (whether or not a private\nsession was, or is to be, held for the Commission);\nwere produced by the Commission.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019-sch-1-sec-16"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019-sch-1-sec-16-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019-sch-1-sec-16-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019-sch-1-sec-16-ss-4-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019-sch-1-sec-16-ss-4-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019-sch-1-sec-16-ss-4-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019-sch-1-sec-16-ss-4-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5209452ce54d2960710d46dc1f4a04ac52c5426457cef7e2bd87b6cbb7773113",
      "skos:note": "Records produced during a private session must be treated as if they were produced by the Commission."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019#sch-1-sec-16-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "16(4) Subsections 6OC(3) and (4)",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 9,
      "values:originalText": "(4) Section 9 (custody and use of records of Royal Commission) also\napplies as if a record that was produced:\n\n(a) at a private session for a Royal Commission by a member\nholding the private session; or\n\n(b) by a member, or member of the staff, of a Royal Commission\nfor the purposes of a private session (whether or not a private\nsession was, or is to be, held for the Commission);\nwere produced by the Commission."
    },
    {
