      "dc:source": "royal-commissions-amendment-private-sessions-act-2019.pdf, p.16",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n(5) An expression used in subsection (2E) that is also used in Part 4 of\nthe Royal Commissions Act 1902 has the same meaning as in that\nPart.",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n\n(5) An expression used in subsection (2E) that is also used in Part 4 of\nthe Royal Commissions Act 1902 has the same meaning as in that\nPart.",
      "cml:asserts": [
